          "description": "Aarti Drugs Limited – Your Trusted API Partner in a Regulated World 🌍💊At Aarti Drugs, we go beyond just manufacturing Active Pharmaceutical Ingredients (APIs) — we deliver trust, quality, and regulatory confidence to pharmaceutical partners across Europe and beyond.With nearly 42 years of experience, we’re proud to be the go-to API partner for companies operating in highly regulated markets. Whether you're launching a new formulation or scaling up existing production, we offer flexible, end-to-end solutions designed to help your business grow.🧪 Focused Expertise in Anti-Inflammatory APIsWe specialize in a broad portfolio with strong capabilities in key anti-inflammatory compounds like:• Aceclofenac• Celecoxib• Diclofenac• Nimesulide... and more — all tailored for regulated markets and manufactured in EU-compliant facilities with full documentation support. Why European Pharma Trusts Us✔ Seamless Global Exports – backed by an experienced logistics team✔ Regulatory Confidence – from dossiers to DMFs, we’ve got you covered✔ Custom Solutions – including tailored packaging and flexible delivery formats✔ Free Development Samples – to support your R&D and trialsLet’s connect if you're looking to:✅ Strengthen your API supply chain✅ Launch or expand in regulated markets✅ Partner with a reliable, EU-compliant API manufacturerWe’re here to support your success with science, service, and long-term collaboration.Let’s start a conversation. 🤝",
