          "description": "Aarti Industries Limited (AIL) is one of the world's leading speciality chemical companies combining process chemistry competence with scale-up engineering competence. Over the years, we have transformed from an Indian company servicing global markets to a global company selecting to manufacture out of India. We globally rank between 1st – 4th position for 75% of our portfolio and are a \"Partner of Choice\" for over 400+ major global & 700+ domestic customers spread across 60 countries with a major presence in the USA, Europe, and Japan.With a de-risked portfolio which is multi-product, multi-geography, multi-customer and multi-industry, we operate through 16 manufacturing sites. With an offering of 100+ products, we cater to a range of end-use products and industries comprising Agrochemicals, Pharmaceuticals, Polymers, Pigments, Printing Inks, Dyes, Fuel additives, Aromatics, and Surfactants.",
